                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='32315' id='62' type-v2='text' w='41510' x='39427' y='67685'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e8e8e8' fontname='Tw Cen MT Condensed Extra Bold' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Reccomendations:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#e8e8e8' fontname='Tw Cen MT Condensed Extra Bold' fontsize='13'>1.</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e8e8e8' fontname='Tw Cen MT Condensed Extra Bold' fontsize='13'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13'>Riot should prioritize in-game promotions tied to esports events (viewer drops, tournament bundles) to capitalize on this segment.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tw Cen MT Condensed Extra Bold' fontsize='13'>2.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13'> Targeted win-back campaigns (returning player bundles, limited-time offers) could be tested here first; Riot could also consider adding new types of guns to apply skins to. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tw Cen MT Condensed Extra Bold' fontsize='13'>3.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13'> Give Diamond+ a reason to play ranked after placement other than for the rank itself or lean in to shorter play time. (e.g giving small amounts of in-game currency as competitive rewards &amp; cheaper purchase options for shorter gamemodes)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e8e8e8' fontname='Tw Cen MT Condensed Extra Bold' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Business Impact:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#e8e8e8' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13'>Targeting high-retention, esports-engaged, and at-risk players can improve conversion, reactivation, and revenue while making marketing spend more efficient.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#e8e8e8' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='5' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='366' h='100000' id='55' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='19063' x='80937' y='0'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3519' id='58' type-v2='text' w='19063' x='80937' y='0'>
