              <zone fixed-size='40' forceUpdate='true' h='4445' id='60' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='19063' x='80937' y='14816'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e8e8e8' fontname='Tw Cen MT Condensed Extra Bold' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Insights:                                                    </run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='52778' id='61' type-v2='text' w='19063' x='80937' y='19261'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13' underline='true'>Esports Watchers</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13'>- Esports watchers are ~19.2% more likely to spend</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13'>- Players who watch are already invested -&gt; more willing to pay for cosmetics </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13' underline='true'>Player Segmentation</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13'>- Churned players represent the largest spender segment at ~25K</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13'>- Highest-priority reactivation opportunity</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13'>- Avg transaction count at 5 for both Churned and at Risk spenders could signify types of skins commonly bought</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13' underline='true'>Purchase Retention by Rank &amp; Session Depth</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13'>-Area of interest Diamond+ players with short sessions(less than a ranked game) -&gt; show near-zero retention</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Comic Sans MS' fontsize='13'>- Hypothesis: high-rank short-session players are likely multi-game FPS players using Valorant as a secondary title or less comepetitive alternative through other gamemodes. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='padding' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
